---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<Layout title="Braces & Orthodontics | Liberty Smile Center" description="Straighten your teeth with braces or clear aligners. Expert orthodontic care in South Gate and Van Nuys.">
  <div class="bg-slate-900 py-20 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20 bg-[url('https://libertysmilecenter.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/Braces-Liberty-Smile-Center.jpg')] bg-cover bg-center"></div>
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Orthodontics & Braces</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-blue-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Achieve a beautifully aligned smile. We treat children, teens, and adults.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
       <div class="prose prose-lg mx-auto text-slate-600">
         <p>
           A straight smile is improved not only in appearance but also in function. Crowded or crooked teeth can be difficult to clean, leading to cavities and gum disease. 
           Orthodontic treatment corrects these issues, contributing to lifelong oral health.
         </p>
         <h3>Our Orthodontic Services</h3>
         <ul>
           <li>Traditional Metal Braces</li>
           <li>Ceramic (Clear) Braces</li>
           <li>Clear Aligners</li>
           <li>Retainers</li>
         </ul>
       </div>
       <div class="text-center mt-12">
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-brand-gold text-slate-900 font-bold rounded-full shadow-lg hover:bg-yellow-500 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1">
          Book Ortho Consultation
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
